        ]
      },
      "worked": "Replace $x\\mapsto \\frac{x}{2}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\ln\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right)\\\\y&=\\ln(x)-\\ln(2)\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe equivalent vertical translation is down $\\ln(2)$ units.",
